ly=Asta Sans,Pretendard,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="385" y="670" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;b&gt;NearbyHub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px' color='#4A5A6A'&gt;core 코드 그대로 · 차 위치는 10초만&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#00AAD2;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#002C5F;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Asta Sans,Pretendard,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="650" y="670" width="220" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c53" value="&lt;b&gt;합류 예고&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px' color='#4A5A6A'&gt;60초 안 합류할 차 × 1km 앞 본선 차&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#00AAD2;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#002C5F;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Asta Sans,Pretendard,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="650" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c54" value="&lt;b&gt;HazardBoard&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px' color='#4A5A6A'&gt;30초 안 다른 차 2대 → 주의보 · 5분 소멸&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#00AAD2;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#002C5F;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Asta Sans,Pretendard,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1210" y="650" width="270" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c55" value="&lt;b&gt;정차 알림&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px' color='#4A5A6A'&gt;뒤 2km(터널 3km), 출발하면 지움&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#00AAD2;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#002C5F;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Asta Sans,Pretendard,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="920" y="770" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c56" value="&lt;b&gt;감사 · 문제 알림 배달&lt;/b&gt